      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHAQ KEEPING (6) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 29.73 to score two back then following on with a 29.65 win over 520m at this track. Flying lately and looks hard to top. PSYCHO CIRCUS (7) recorded a 3 length second in a Grade 3/4 last time 29.86 at this track and trip and also jumping from the same draw. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability and looks a key chance. DOMINEERING (2) was a NG winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 2 this time where he has performed well. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Can feature with the right run. MAXIMUS MERIDIUS (1) warrants respect following a recent placing.",
